{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Customer Complaint", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "This One's on Us", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Dealing with Customers: Apologizing", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When things go wrong when you are at work, you can talk about the problems using <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should not</span> and <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you say that you <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">should not</span> do something, it means it is a good idea or not a good idea.<br/><br/>When you say you are <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">not supposed to</span>, it means that you have some duty or responsibility to do or not do something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Implied Meaning:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I realize I should be on top of everything.  <br/><br/>  They are supposed to be very reliable.  <br/><br/> A night out at a restaurant is supposed to be a positive experience.  <br/><br/>It shouldn't end with salty cherry cheesecake.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am not on top of this.   <br/><br/>They are not reliable. <br/><br/>This is not a positive experience.  <br/><br/> It did end with salty cheesecake.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Discussing How to Deal with Problems", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you deal with problems you can use modals like: <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">might want to</span>, for what is advisable.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the modals to show what is necessary or advisable to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You ought to sue the supplier.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You might want to change suppliers altogether.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They ought to trace the sugar bag back to the packaging company, though.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There'd better not be.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You might want to tell your staff to be extra careful for a while.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You might want to go easy on the young chef. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "positive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "good", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A night out at a restaurant is supposed to be a positive experience.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about a problem at a restaurant.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "inconvenience", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a problem causing delay or discomfort", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I realize this was an inconvenience.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to your satisfaction", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way you want it", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hope the other dessert we brought was to your satisfaction. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to sue", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go to a law court to collect money from someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You ought to sue the supplier.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "supplier", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a company or person that provides goods", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The supplier mixed up the order to be delivered.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "reliable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "able to be counted on", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are supposed to be very reliable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to trace", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go back to the origin", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They ought to trace the sugar bag back to the packaging company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "humbly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "with humility", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Again, I humbly apologize.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to go easy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to not punish severely", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  You might want to go easy on the young chef.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take into account", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to consider when deciding", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll take that into account.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Imagine you are a waiter or waitress working in a restaurant and a customer has a complaint. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The customer complains about the food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The waiter/waitress apologizes for the mistake.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The customer says what is advisable for the restaurant to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue then try the role play without it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the same language.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue about a complaint from a customer in a restaurant.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I apologize politely with <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">should</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say what needs to be done with <span class=\"italic\">ought</span>, <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> and <span class=\"italic\">might</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I role play the situation.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can deal with a difficult customer.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things I am supposed to do and things that are supposed to happen.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When was the last time you burned food when you were cooking it?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How did you deal with the problem?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "There was a problem in the kitchen!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Vanessa apologized for an <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">unforeseen</span> problem.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\"Unforeseen\"</span> means that you did did not realize this could be a problem before it happened.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "conten